{"type":"message","id":"3007d4e8-2ceb-4ca1-8aa0-667c84c1b1d8","role":"user","content":"Another language model started to solve this problem and produced a summary of its thinking process. You also have access to the state of the tools that were used by that language model. Use this to build on the work that has already been done and avoid duplicating work. Here is the summary produced by the other language model, use the information in this summary to assist with your own analysis:\n# 上下文检查点摘要\n\n## 当前进度\n\n正在将 ShopEase 电商项目从 **MongoDB 重构为 SQLite**。已完成部分：\n\n### ✅ 已完成\n- `server/package.json` — 更新了依赖（移除 mongodb/mongoose，添加 better-sqlite3/bcryptjs/jsonwebtoken）\n- `server/.env` — 更新为 `DATABASE_PATH=./database.sqlite`\n- `server/src/config/index.ts` — 更新配置（dbPath）\n- `server/src/config/database.ts` — **已重写为 SQLite**（使用 better-sqlite3，创建 users/products/cart_items/orders/order_items 五张表）\n- `server/src/models/index.ts` — 重构为 TypeScript 类型导出（User/Product/CartItem/Order/OrderItem）\n- `server/src/middleware/auth.ts` — **已重写**（JWT 验证 + 管理员授权，使用 SQLite 查询用户）\n- `server/src/utils/order.ts` — 保留原样（订单号生成器，无数据库依赖）\n- 删除了旧文件：`server/src/models/User.ts`、`Product.ts`、`CartItem.ts`、`Order.ts`\n- `server/src/routes/auth.ts` — **已重写**（使用 SQLite 查询 + bcryptjs）\n\n### 🔄 进行中（下一阶段需继续）\n- **`server/src/routes/products.ts`** — 需要重写（当前可能还是 MongoDB 查询）\n- **`server/src/routes/cart.ts`** — 需要重写\n- **`server/src/routes/orders.ts`** — 需要重写\n- **`server/src/scripts/seed.ts`** — 需要重写（插入种子数据到 SQLite）\n- **测试文件** `server/tests/*.test.ts` — 需要重写（用 SQLite 内存数据库或文件数据库替代 mongodb-memory-server）\n- **前端** — 无需修改（API 接口不变，只是后端存储层变化）\n\n## 关键约束与偏好\n\n1. **使用 `better-sqlite3`**（同步高性能 SQLite 驱动），不使用重型 ORM\n2. **直接编写 SQL**，保持清晰和可维护性\n3. **密码加密使用 bcryptjs**\n4. **JWT 认证**保持不变\n5. API 接口路径和返回格式**必须与之前保持一致**（前端无需改动）\n6. 所有 SQL 查询使用**参数化查询**防止注入\n\n## 数据库表结构（已创建）\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE users (\n  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\n  name TEXT NOT NULL,\n  email TEXT UNIQUE NOT NULL,\n  password TEXT NOT NULL,\n  role TEXT DEFAULT 'user',\n  phone TEXT,\n  address TEXT,\n  avatar TEXT,\n  createdAt TEXT DEFAULT (datetime('now')),\n  updatedAt TEXT DEFAULT (datetime('now'))\n);\n\nCREATE TABLE products (\n  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\n  name TEXT NOT NULL,\n  description TEXT,\n  price REAL NOT NULL,\n  stock INTEGER DEFAULT 0,\n  category TEXT,\n  image TEXT,\n  rating REAL DEFAULT 0,\n  sales INTEGER DEFAULT 0,\n  featured INTEGER DEFAULT 0,\n  createdAt TEXT DEFAULT (datetime('now')),\n  updatedAt TEXT DEFAULT (datetime('now'))\n);\n\nCREATE TABLE cart_items (\n  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\n  userId INTEGER NOT NULL,\n  productId INTEGER NOT NULL,\n  quantity INTEGER DEFAULT 1,\n  createdAt TEXT DEFAULT (datetime('now')),\n  updatedAt TEXT DEFAULT (datetime('now')),\n  FOREIGN KEY (userId) REFERENCES users(id),\n  FOREIGN KEY (productId) REFERENCES products(id),\n  UNIQUE(userId, productId)\n);\n\nCREATE TABLE orders (\n  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\n  orderNo TEXT UNIQUE NOT NULL,\n  userId INTEGER NOT NULL,\n  totalAmount REAL NOT NULL,\n  status TEXT DEFAULT 'pending',\n  shippingAddress TEXT,\n  createdAt TEXT DEFAULT (datetime('now')),\n  updatedAt TEXT DEFAULT (datetime('now')),\n  FOREIGN KEY (userId) REFERENCES users(id)\n);\n\nCREATE TABLE order_items (\n  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\n  orderId INTEGER NOT NULL,\n  productId INTEGER NOT NULL,\n  productName TEXT NOT NULL,\n  price REAL NOT NULL,\n  quantity INTEGER NOT NULL,\n  FOREIGN KEY (orderId) REFERENCES orders(id),\n  FOREIGN KEY (productId) REFERENCES products(id)\n);\n```\n\n## 关键参考数据\n\n- **管理账号**: admin@shopease.com / admin123（role=admin）\n- **测试用户**: user@shopease.com / user123（role=user）\n- **种子商品**: 12 个商品（电子产品、服装、食品等分类）\n- **数据库文件路径**: `server/database.sqlite`（自动创建）\n- **测试数据库路径**: `server/test.sqlite`（测试用）\n- **JWT_SECRET**: shopease-jwt-secret-key-2024\n\n## 下一步工作（按优先级）\n\n1. **重写 `server/src/routes/products.ts`** — 将所有 Product.find/findById 等替换为 SQLite 查询\n2. **重写 `server/src/routes/cart.ts`** — 替换购物车 CRUD 为 SQLite\n3. **重写 `server/src/routes/orders.ts`** — 替换订单 + 库存扣减为 SQLite（注意事务处理）\n4. **重写 `server/src/scripts/seed.ts`** — 插入种子数据\n5. **重写测试文件** — 使用 SQLite 内存数据库或临时文件\n6. **更新 `server/src/index.ts`** — 确保路由挂载正确（可能已引用新路由，需检查）\n7. **测试运行** — `cd server && npx ts-node src/scripts/seed.ts` 验证种子数据，`npm test` 运行测试\n\n## 续写位置\n\n从 **`server/src/routes/products.ts`** 开始继续重写。当前 auth.ts 已完成，products.ts/cart.ts/orders.ts/seed.ts 和测试文件等待重写。所有已修改的文件都在 `D:\\123\\server\\src\\` 下。","timestamp":1781395899,"tool_call_id":null,"tool_name":null,"tool_calls":null}
