{"type":"message","id":"5f0aa6e4-aa99-4347-b651-e06c6ff876d3","role":"assistant","content":" \n\nAlso, the screenshot shows the page is loaded correctly with navigation, products, and the login/register buttons.  \n\nNow let me check the page source for the routing:</think>很好！我现在看到页面结构了。导航栏中有\"首页\"和\"全部商品\"的菜单项，右上角有\"登 录\"和\"注 册\"按钮。前端使用了 React Router，让我查看路由配置：\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","timestamp":1781397379,"tool_call_id":null,"tool_name":null,"tool_calls":null}
