{"type":"message","id":"ed75e218-ef21-43cb-b5ee-e85460059adb","role":"tool","content":"import { useState } from 'react';\nimport { Card, Form, Input, Button, message, Typography, Divider } from 'antd';\nimport { MailOutlined, LockOutlined } from '@ant-design/icons';\nimport { Link, useNavigate, useSearchParams } from 'react-router-dom';\nimport { useAuthStore } from '../store/authStore';\n\nconst { Title, Text } = Typography;\n\nexport default function LoginPage() {\n  const navigate = useNavigate();\n  const [searchParams] = useSearchParams();\n  const { login, isLoading } = useAuthStore();\n  const [form] = Form.useForm();\n\n  const redirect = searchParams.get('redirect') || '/';\n\n  const handleSubmit = async (values: { email: string; password: string }) => {\n    try {\n      await login(values.email, values.password);\n      message.success('登录成功！');\n      navigate(redirect, { replace: true });\n    } catch (error: any) {\n      message.error(error.message);\n    }\n  };\n\n  // 快速登录填充\n  const fillCredentials = (type: 'admin' | 'user') => {\n    if (type === 'admin') {\n      form.setFieldsValue({ email: 'admin@shopease.com', password: 'admin123' });\n    } else {\n      form.setFieldsValue({ email: 'user@shopease.com', password: 'user123' });\n    }\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"auth-container\">\n      <Card className=\"auth-card\">\n        <div style={{ textAlign: 'center', marginBottom: 24 }}>\n          <Title level={3}>欢迎回来</Title>\n          <Text type=\"secondary\">登录您的 ShopEase 账户</Text>\n        </div>\n\n        <Form form={form} layout=\"vertical\" onFinish={handleSubmit} autoComplete=\"off\">\n          <Form.Item\n            name=\"email\"\n            label=\"邮箱\"\n            rules={[\n              { required: true, message: '请输入邮箱' },\n              { type: 'email', message: '请输入有效的邮箱地址' },\n            ]}\n          >\n            <Input prefix={<MailOutlined />} placeholder=\"请输入邮箱\" size=\"large\" />\n          </Form.Item>\n\n          <Form.Item\n            name=\"password\"\n            label=\"密码\"\n            rules={[\n              { required: true, message: '请输入密码' },\n              { min: 6, message: '密码至少6位' },\n            ]}\n          >\n            <Input.Password prefix={<LockOutlined />} placeholder=\"请输入密码\" size=\"large\" />\n          </Form.Item>\n\n          <Form.Item>\n            <Button type=\"primary\" htmlType=\"submit\" size=\"large\" block loading={isLoading}>\n              登录\n            </Button>\n          </Form.Item>\n        </Form>\n\n        <Divider>\n          <Text type=\"secondary\" style={{ fontSize: 12 }}>快速体验</Text>\n        </Divider>\n\n        <div style={{ display: 'flex', gap: 8 }}>\n          <Button size=\"small\" onClick={() => fillCredentials('user')} block>\n            测试用户\n          </Button>\n          <Button size=\"small\" onClick={() => fillCredentials('admin')} block>\n            管理员\n          </Button>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style={{ textAlign: 'center', marginTop: 16 }}>\n          <Text type=\"secondary\">还没有账户？</Text>\n          <Link to=\"/register\">立即注册</Link>\n        </div>\n      </Card>\n    </div>\n  );\n}","timestamp":1781397404,"tool_call_id":"call_f50ceb45c1574c24953a2d1c","tool_name":"read_file","tool_calls":null}
{"type":"message","id":"f473f846-1f34-420c-8eb9-e6790ca89343","role":"assistant","content":"现在我完全明白了！登录页面有：\n1. 邮箱输入框（placeholder=\"请输入邮箱\"）\n2. 密码输入框（placeholder=\"请输入密码\"）\n3. 快速填充按钮（\"测试用户\"和\"管理员\"）\n4. 登录按钮\n\n让我直接用 JS 操作来实现自动化登录测试：\n\n\n\n\n让我们一次性完成这个过程。我先查看页面的截图，然后直接进行测试。从源代码我看到了组件的结构。让我尝试直接用较通用的方式找到输入元素：\n\n\n\n等等，刚才的浏览器 WebView 可能因为 session 过期而关闭了。让我创建一个新的 browser session：\n\n\n\n**界面测试计划：**\n\n鉴于截图已经展示了登录页面，我现在直接从源码层面获取表单结构，然后用 JS 方式直接操作 antd 表单内部的 input。如果无法操作 antd 的 Form 内部 input，我可以采用直接在页面上调用 form.setFieldsValue() 的方式。\n\n但是，用 React 组件的方式来操作会更困难。最简单有效的方式是：直接调用页面的 React state 更新函数来填充值，或者点击\"测试用户\"按钮自动填充。\n\n让我一次性完成整个自动化测试流程，用最可靠的方法：每个步骤都验证。</think>\n\n好，让我直接从登录页面开始自动化测试。我先打开 login 页面，然后使用\"测试用户\"按钮快速填充，再进行登录：\n\n\n","timestamp":1781397409,"tool_call_id":null,"tool_name":null,"tool_calls":null}
